ocale":"en"},"1165":{"id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf-318","page_id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf#cli","content":"`CliConf` contains only `log`. The default CLI log level is `warn`, with output to stdout.","locale":"en"},"1166":{"id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf-319","page_id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf#job","content":"`[job]` configures the legacy Master-side job implementation used by clients with `transfer.enabled = false`. Transfer jobs use `[transfer]` for ownership, recovery, and retention.","locale":"en"},"1167":{"id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf-320","page_id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf#job","content":"| Field          | Default | Meaning             |\n| -------------- | ------- | ------------------- |\n| `job_life_ttl` | `24h`   | Job record lifetime |","locale":"en","table":"table-10"},"1168":{"id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf-321","page_id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf#job","content":"| Field             | Default | Meaning                           |\n| ----------------- | ------- | --------------------------------- |\n| `job_cleanup_ttl` | `10m`   | Cleanup interval for expired jobs |","locale":"en","table":"table-10"},"1169":{"id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf-322","page_id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf#job","co