ster","content":"| Parameter               | Default | Description                    |\n| ----------------------- | ------- | ------------------------------ |\n| `cluster.formatJournal` | `false` | Format journal data on startup |","locale":"en","table":"table-3"},"1281":{"id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/k8s-Deployment-57","page_id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/k8s-Deployment","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/k8s-Deployment#image","content":"| Parameter          | Default                     | Description      |\n| ------------------ | --------------------------- | ---------------- |\n| `image.repository` | `ghcr.io/curvineio/curvine` | Image repository |","locale":"en","table":"table-4"},"1282":{"id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/k8s-Deployment-58","page_id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/k8s-Deployment","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/k8s-Deployment#image","content":"| Parameter   | Default | Description                      |\n| ----------- | ------- | -------------------------------- |\n| `image.tag` | `\"\"`    | Empty uses `v{Chart.AppVersion}` |","locale":"en","table":"table-4"},"1283":{"id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/k8s-Deployment-59","page_id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/k8s-Deployment","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/k8s-Deployment#image","content":"| Parameter          | Default        | Description       |\n| ------------------ | -------------- | ----------------- |\n| `image.pullPolicy` | `IfNotPresent` | Image pull policy |","locale":"en","table":"table-4"},"1284":{"id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/k8s-Deployment-60","page_id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/k8s-Deployment","tags":[],"type":"text","url":