ject root, run:","locale":"en"},"1463":{"id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Preparation/deployment-setup-21","page_id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Preparation/deployment-setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Preparation/deployment-setup#create-installation-package","content":"This runs `make all` (if needed), then packages the contents of `build/dist` into a tar.gz file. The archive is created in the **project root** with a name like `curvine-<platform>-<arch>-<timestamp>.tar.gz`, or `curvine-<version>-<platform>-<arch>.tar.gz` if you set `RELEASE_VERSION` (e.g. `RELEASE_VERSION=v1.0.0 make dist`). This archive is the Curvine installation package for deployment or for building runtime images.","locale":"en"},"1464":{"id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Preparation/deployment-setup-22","page_id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Preparation/deployment-setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Preparation/deployment-setup#environment-script-and-main-config","content":"After unpacking the installation package, the key files are:","locale":"en"},"1465":{"id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Preparation/deployment-setup-23","page_id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Preparation/deployment-setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Preparation/deployment-setup#environment-script-and-main-config","content":"`conf/curvine-env.sh`: shell-side environment setup","locale":"en"},"1466":{"id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Preparation/deployment-setup-24","page_id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Preparation/deployment-setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Preparation/deployment-setup#environment-script-and-main-config","content":"`conf/curvine-cluster.toml`: main cluster configuration","locale":"en"},"1467":{"id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Preparation/deployment-setup-25","page_id":"/docs/Deplo