nfigruntimejson","content":"关于 `/etc/fluid/config/runtime.json`","locale":"zh-cn"},"3303":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration-14","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration#thinruntime-快速开始","content":"ThinRuntime 快速开始","locale":"zh-cn"},"3304":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration-15","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration#1-创建-thinruntimeprofile","content":"1. 创建 ThinRuntimeProfile","locale":"zh-cn"},"3305":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration-16","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration#2-创建-dataset","content":"2. 创建 Dataset","locale":"zh-cn"},"3306":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration-17","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration#3-创建-thinruntime","content":"3. 创建 ThinRuntime","locale":"zh-cn"},"3307":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration-18","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration#4-验证-thinruntime","content":"4. 验证 ThinRuntime","locale":"zh-cn"},"3308":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration-19","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration#排障","content":"排障","locale":"zh-cn"},"3309":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration-20","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration#镜像进入了错误模式","content":"镜像进入了错误模式","locale":"zh-cn"},"3310":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration-21","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration#cacheruntime-pod-无法生成-curvine-配置","content":"CacheRuntime Pod 无法生成 Curvine 配置","locale":"zh-cn"},"3311":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration-22","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration#mountufs-失败","content":"MountUFS 失败","locale":"zh-cn"},"3312":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration-23","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration#fuse-没挂上","content":"FUSE 没挂上","locale":"zh-cn"},"3313":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration-24","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration#dataload-job-启动后失败","content":"DataLoad Job 启动后失败","locale":"zh-cn"},"3314":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration-25","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration","content":"Fluid 可以把 Kubernetes 里的 `Dataset` 暴露给业务 Pod。Curvine 可以作为这个 Dataset 背后的缓存运行时，也可以作为一个已经存在的存储集群，由 Fluid 负责挂载到业务 Pod。","locale":"zh-cn"},"3315":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration-26","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration","content":"如果是新接入 Fluid，建议优先使用 **CacheRuntime**。它会让 Fluid 拉起 Curvine master、worker 和 FUSE client Pod，也是支持 `DataLoad` 数据预热的主要方式。","locale":"zh-cn"},"3316":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration-27","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration#选择接入方式","content":"| 模式           | 适用场景                                      | Fluid 会启动什么                            | 主要资源                                         |\n| ------------ | ----------------------------------------- | -------------------------------------- | -------------------------------------------- |\n| CacheRuntime | 希望 Fluid 在 Kubernetes 中管理一套 Curvine 缓存集群。 | Curvine master、worker、client/FUSE Pod。 | `CacheRuntimeClass`、`Dataset`、`CacheRuntime` |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-0"},"3317":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration-28","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration#选择接入方式","content":"| 模式          | 适用场景                                   | Fluid 会启动什么               | 主要资源                                         |\n| ----------- | -------------------------------------- | ------------------------- | -------------------------------------------- |\n| ThinRuntime | 已经有一套 Curvine 集群，只希望 Fluid 把它挂进业务 Pod。 | 只启动 Curvine FUSE runtime。 | `ThinRuntimeProfile`、`Dataset`、`ThinRuntime` |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-0"},"3318":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration-29","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration#选择接入方式","content":"大多数新用户应选择 CacheRuntime。ThinRuntime 更适合 Curvine 已经独立运维的场景。","locale":"zh-cn"},"3319":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration-30","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration#文件与参考资料","content":"Curvine 的 Fluid 物料在 Curvine 源码中：","locale":"zh-cn"},"3320":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration-31","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration#文件与参考资料","content":"| 文件                                   | 用途                                       |\n| ------------------------------------ | ---------------------------------------- |\n| `curvine-docker/deploy/Dockerfile_*` | 构建普通 `curvine` 运行时镜像；Fluid 支持已经包含在这个镜像里。 |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-1"},"3321":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration-32","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration#文件与参考资料","content":"| 文件                                    | 用途                                                            |\n| ------------------------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `curvine-docker/deploy/entrypoint.sh` | 启动普通 Curvine 服务；如果检测到 Fluid 运行时模式，则转到 `/fluid-entrypoint.sh`。 |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-1"},"3322":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration-33","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration#文件与参考资料","content":"| 文件                                   | 用途                                                                             |\n| ------------------------------------ | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------ |\n| `curvine-docker/fluid/entrypoint.sh` | Fluid 入口脚本，会作为 `/fluid-entrypoint.sh` 打进主镜像，并判断 CacheRuntime / ThinRuntime 模式。 |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-1"},"3323":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration-34","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration#文件与参考资料","content":"| 文件                                        | 用途                                                           |\n| ----------------------------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------ |\n| `curvine-docker/fluid/generate_config.py` | 解析 Fluid runtime JSON，为 CacheRuntime Pod 生成 Curvine TOML 配置。 |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-1"},"3324":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration-35","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration#文件与参考资料","content":"| 文件                                     | 用途                           