够与各种存储后端无缝协作，同时保持统一的接口。","locale":"zh-cn"},"3559":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/opendal-integration-18","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/opendal-integration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/opendal-integration#什么是-opendal","content":"OpenDAL 是一个数据访问层，提供统一的 API 来访问各种存储服务。它作为应用程序和存储系统之间的抽象层，提供：","locale":"zh-cn"},"3560":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/opendal-integration-19","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/opendal-integration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/opendal-integration#什么是-opendal","content":"**统一接口**：跨不同存储后端的一致 API","locale":"zh-cn"},"3561":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/opendal-integration-20","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/opendal-integration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/opendal-integration#什么是-opendal","content":"**多存储支持**：支持对象存储、文件系统、数据库等多种存储类型","locale":"zh-cn"},"3562":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/opendal-integration-21","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/opendal-integration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/opendal-integration#什么是-opendal","content":"**高性能**：优化的数据访问路径和缓存机制","locale":"zh-cn"},"3563":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/opendal-integration-22","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/opendal-integration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/opendal-integration#什么是-opendal","content":"**可扩展性**：轻松添加新的存储后端支持","locale":"zh-cn"},"3564":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/opendal-integration-23","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/opendal-integration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/opendal-integration#什么是-opendal","content":"**可靠性**：内置重试机制和错误处理","locale":"zh-cn"},"3565":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/opendal-integration-24","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/opendal-integration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/opendal-integration#支持的存储后端","content":"通过 OpenDAL 集成，Curvine 目前支持以下存储服务：","locale":"zh-cn"},"3566":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/opendal-integration-25","page_id"