e":"zh-cn"},"4118":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Contribute/roadmap-19","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Contribute/roadmap","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Contribute/roadmap#如何参与","content":"如果已有对应任务，直接在 GitHub Issues 中参与讨论。","locale":"zh-cn"},"4119":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Contribute/roadmap-20","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Contribute/roadmap","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Contribute/roadmap#如何参与","content":"如果是更宽泛的方向建议，优先在 GitHub Discussions 中提出。","locale":"zh-cn"},"4120":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Contribute/roadmap-21","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Contribute/roadmap","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Contribute/roadmap#如何参与","content":"更新文档时，确保命令、构建产物和功能描述都与参考仓库当前实际可见的状态一致。","locale":"zh-cn"},"4121":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/Bare-Metal-Deployment","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/Bare-Metal-Deployment","type":"page","content":"裸机部署","breadcrumbs":["Documents","部署","部署集群","分布式模式"],"tags":[],"url":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/Bare-Metal-Deployment","locale":"zh-cn"},"4122":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/Bare-Metal-Deployment-0","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/Bare-Metal-Deployment","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/Bare-Metal-Deployment#逻辑部署架构","content":"逻辑部署架构","locale":"zh-cn"},"4123":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/Bare-Metal-Deployment-1","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/Bare-Metal-Deployment","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/Bare-Metal-Deployment#启动命令","content":"启动命令","locale":"zh-cn"},"4124":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/Bare-Metal-Deployment-2","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/Bare-Metal-Deployment","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/Bare-Metal-Deployment","content":"部署前需要创建安装包与修改配置文件。","locale":"zh-cn"},"4125":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/Bare-Metal-Deployment-3","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/Bare-Metal-Deployment","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/Bare-Metal-Deployment#逻辑部署架构","content":"下图是 Curvine 裸机部署的逻辑架构。**集群核心**仅由 Master 与 Worker 进程组成，二者启动后集群即可对外服务。FUSE 是**可选的**访问方式，**不参与**集群启动——仅在应用需要 POSIX 挂载点时再启用。","locale":"zh-cn"},"4126":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/Bare-Metal-Deployment-4","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/Bare-Metal-Deployment","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/Bare-Metal-Deployment#逻辑部署架构","content":"**集群核心（必选）：** 在规划的主机上启动 `curvine-master` 与 `curvine-worker`。二者就绪后集群即可工作，可通过 CLI（`cv`）或 SDK 访问，**无需先启动 FUSE**。","locale":"zh-cn"},"4127":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/Bare-Metal-Deployment-5","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/Bare-Metal-Deployment","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/Bare-Metal-Deployment#逻辑部署架构","content":"**FUSE（可选）：** 仅当需要 POSIX 文件系统挂载（如兼容旧工具、脚本）时再启动 `curvine-fuse`。FUSE 不是核心服务，集群的启动与运行不依赖它。","locale":"zh-cn"},"4128":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/Bare-Metal-Deployment-6","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/Bare-Metal-Deployment","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/Bare-Metal-Deployment#逻辑部署架构","content":"如需让 Load 和 Export 使用独立调度，应在集群健康后部署独立的可选 Transfer 服务。\n它不加入 Master Raft 组，也不要求修改 Master 或 Worker 配置。参见\n物理机部署 Transfer。","locale":"zh-cn"},"4129":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/Bare-Metal-Deployment-7","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/Bare-Metal-Deployment","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/Bare-Metal-Deployment#逻辑部署架构","content":"**FUSE 不参与集群启动。** Curvine 集群由 Master 与 Worker 组成。FUSE 与 CLI、SDK 一样，只是多种访问方式之一，仅在应用需要本地挂载点时才有必要启用。","locale":"zh-cn"},"4130":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/Bare-Metal-Deployment-8","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/Bare-Metal-Deployment","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/Bare-Metal-Deployment#逻辑部署架构","content":"每台 Worker 需要有自己确定的 IP。多网卡环境下，建议通过环境变量显式指定 IP，避免自动取到预期外的网卡地址。","locale":"zh-cn"},"4131":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/Bare-Metal-Deployment-9","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/Bare-Metal-Deployment","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/Bare-Metal-Deployment#启动命令","content":"裸机部署需手动启动**集群核心**（master 与 worker）；仅在需要 POSIX 挂载的节点上**按需**启动 FUSE：","locale":"zh-cn"},"4132":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf","type":"page","content":"配置参考","breadcrumbs":["Documents","部署","部署集群","分布式模式"],"tags":[],"url":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf","locale":"zh-cn"},"4133":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf-0","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf#配置来源","content":"配置来源","locale":"zh-cn"},"4134":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf-1","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":