id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf-27","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf#配置来源","content":"| 变量                  | 作用                           |\n| ------------------- | ---------------------------- |\n| `CURVINE_CONF_FILE` | 覆盖 `curvine-cluster.toml` 路径 |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-0"},"4161":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf-28","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf#配置来源","content":"| 变量                        | 作用                    |\n| ------------------------- | --------------------- |\n| `CURVINE_MASTER_HOSTNAME` | 覆盖 Master 实际 hostname |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-0"},"4162":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf-29","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf#配置来源","content":"| 变量                     | 作用                 |\n| ---------------------- | ------------------ |\n| `CURVINE_MDS_HOSTNAME` | 覆盖 MDS 实际 hostname |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-0"},"4163":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf-30","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf#配置来源","content":"| 变量                        | 作用                    |\n| ------------------------- | --------------------- |\n| `CURVINE_WORKER_HOSTNAME` | 覆盖 Worker 实际 hostname |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-0"},"4164":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf-31","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf#配置来源","content":"| 变量                        | 作用                     |\n| ------------------------- | ---------------------- |\n| `CURVINE_CLIENT_HOSTNAME` | 覆盖客户端 hostname，用于本地性判断 |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-0"},"4165":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf-32","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf#配置来源","content":"| 变量                          | 作用                      |\n| --------------------------- | ----------------------- |\n| `CURVINE_TRANSFER_HOSTNAME` | 覆盖 Transfer 服务 hostname |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-0"},"4166":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf-33","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf#配置加载流程","content":"未知配置键会由 `validation::warn_unknown_keys` 输出警告，但不会导致启动失败。拼错的键会静默保留默认值，因此请始终检查启动日志中的警告。","locale":"zh-cn"},"4167":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf-34","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf#配置加载流程","content":"`client.master_addrs` 可以省略。为空时，Curvine 使用 `master.rpc_port` 从 `journal.journal_addrs` 推导；如果 `journal_addrs` 也为空，则使用 `master.hostname:master.rpc_port`。","locale":"zh-cn"},"4168":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf-35","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf#配置加载流程","content":"独立 Transfer 服务使用简化加载流程（`ClusterConf::from_transfer`），只校验 client 与 transfer 段落。","locale":"zh-cn"},"4169":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf-36","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf#net_interface","content":"当 `net_interface` 非空（例如 `\"eth0\"`）时，Curvine 会解析该网卡的第一个 IPv4 地址，并将其应用到 `master`、`mds`、`journal`、`worker`、`client` 和 `transfer` 的 hostname。设置该字段后，`CURVINE_*_HOSTNAME` 环境变量会被忽略。","locale":"zh-cn"},"4170":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf-37","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf#net_interface","content":"`net_interface` 只填充**本节点自身**的 hostname。集群成员列表（`journal.journal_addrs` 与 `client.master_addrs`）仍必须显式填写，且每个节点的条目必须使用其网卡实际解析出的 IPv4。否则节点无法在 Raft 组中定位自己，启动时会给出明确错误。","locale":"zh-cn"},"4171":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf-38","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf#当前配置布局","content":"当前 `ClusterConf` 的主要段落如下：","locale":"zh-cn"},"4172":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf-39","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf#当前配置布局","content":"| 段落   | 作用                                                                     |\n| ---- | ---------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| 顶层字段 | `format_master`、`format_worker`、`testing`、`cluster_id`、`net_interface` |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-1"},"4173":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf-40","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf","tags":[],"type":"text","url":