ted architecture design with multi-replica mechanisms and failover mechanisms to ensure system high availability:"],[2839,"Curvine also exposes a FUSE file system interface. After mounting it, for example via `bin/curvine-fuse.sh start`, you can operate on the mount point with normal Linux tools:"],[1,"Curvine and Fluid Integration"],[869,"Curvine commonly uses these inputs together:"],[1246,"Curvine config (`config.*`)"],[3258,"Curvine configuration adjustment example:"],[1788,"Curvine consists of three main server-side roles plus clients and UFS:"],[2205,"Curvine CSI has three moving parts:"],[5498,"Curvine CSI 主要由三部分组成："],[155,"Curvine design doc"],[3442,"Curvine design doc"],[3287,"Curvine Documentation"],[2519,"Curvine does not follow Close-to-Open. Instead, it is fully consistent with local disk file semantics:"],[1851,"Curvine exposes multiple access paths for analytics, AI, and data infrastructure workloads, including the Rust CLI, FUSE, and Java/Python SDK bindings."],[2438,"Curvine follows local disk usage habits."],[3279,"Curvine FUSE currently does not support page cache."],[3276,"Curvine FUSE currently supports FUSE2 and FUSE3. FUSE2's performance is approximately only 50% of FUSE3, so it's recommended to use FUSE3 in production environments."],[3179,"Curvine FUSE is fully asynchronous — `attr_timeout` and `entry_timeout` are optional. Increase them for read-heavy workloads with stable metadata:"],[6470,"Curvine FUSE is fully asynchronous — `attr_timeout` and `entry_timeout` are optional. Increase them for read-heavy workloads with stable metadata:"],[1996,"Curvine FUSE supports:"],[1610,"curvine fuse Use Cases"],[4904,"curvine fuse 使用场景"],[5289,"Curvine FUSE 支持："],[6570,"curvine fuse目前不支持page cache。"],[6567,"curvine fuse目前支持fuse2、fuse3；fuse2的性能大约只有fuse3的50%，因此建议在生产环境中使用fuse3。"],[1454,"Curvine has no minimum resource requirements and can support extremely high concurrency and traffic with very small resources. Here is a reference configuration:"],[271,"Curvine integrates with OpenDAL (Open Data Access Layer) at its core, providing powerful storage ecosystem support. This integration enables Curvine to work seamlessly with various storage backends while maintaining a unified interface."],[345,"Curvine interacts with the SPDK C library through a thin FFI layer that insulates Rust code from SPDK's C ABI. Three techniques are used:"],[171,"Curvine is a distributed file cache layer. The **Master** manages metadata and block placement; **Workers** store block data and serve read/write; **Clients** (FUSE, SDK, CLI) talk to Master for metadata and to Workers for data. Metadata is replicated via **Raft** for high availability."],[2431,"Curvine is a distributed file cache system. It integrates storage media inside the cluster and remote storage resources to build a unified file directory space, and provides a directly mountable filesystem to external users."],[1849,"Curvine is a high-performance distributed cache system written in Rust and released under the Apache 2.0 license. It provides a unified cached file-system view over external storage systems, with low-latency metadata access, high-throughput data access, and POSIX-compatible FUSE integration."],[1861,"Curvine is designed for high-performance, high-concurrency, and massive data caching scenarios:"],[2440,"Curvine is not limited to sequential or append-only writes. It supports writing at any file position at any time, which fits scenarios such as databases and large-file modification that require random reads and writes."],[4903,"curvine master、curvine worker 与 curvine fuse 的关系"],[208,"Curvine Metadata Architecture"],[1897,"Curvine Open Source Edition (GiB/s)"],[1925,"Curvine Open Source Edition (GiB/s)"],[5190,"Curvine Open Source Edition (GiB/s)"],[5218,"Curvine Open Source Edition (GiB/s)"],[2545,"Curvine optimization: Curvine tracks opened files. If a file is modified, the page cache automatically becomes invalid to ensure the latest data is read."],[1844,"Curvine Overview"],[2572,"Curvine path, or CV path: the unified logical path inside the cluster. It always starts with `/` and belongs to Curvine's `cv://` namespace. On the client side, it is the mount point directory that users can directly access."],[2574,"Curvine persists the mount table in metadata, so there is no need to remount when Curvine restarts. However, some rules must be followed:"],[2569,"Curvine provides a UFS (Unified File System) view to manage all supported distributed storage systems, including local filesystems, S3/MinIO, HDFS, and others. In simple terms, Curvine UFS mounting creates a path mapping that integrates external storage systems into Curvine's own filesystem. Users no longer need to remember different storage access methods and can access all storage through one unified interface."],[3024,"Curvine provides an intuitive and user-friendly web management interface that allows users to monitor cluster status in real-time, manage file systems, view worker node information, and configure system parameters through a web browser. The web interface serves as a visual operations platform for cluster operations and daily management, enabling most administrative tasks to be completed without complex command-line operations."],[1413,"Curvine provides compilation images on Docker Hub: `curvine/curvine-compile:latest` (and optionally `curvine/curvine-compile:build-cached` with cached dependencies)."],[2128,"Curvine provides multi-language SDKs so applications can access the Curvine filesystem via RPC (metadata from Master, block data from Workers) without using FUSE."],[70,"Curvine reports values that the master can return cheaply: cached bytes, cache capacity, and file count. `ufsTotal`, `cachedPercentage`, and `cacheHitRatio` stay `0` until Curvine has authoritative UFS total and hit-ratio metadata. This avoids showing a cache-capacity percentage as a Dataset cache percentage."],[812,"Curvine Roadmap"],[5349,"Curvine S3 对象存储网关是一个高性能、企业级的 S3 兼容网关，为 Curvine 分布式文件缓存系统提供标准的 AWS S3 API 访问能力。通过这个网关，用户可以使用任何支持 S3 协议的工具和应用程序来访问 Curvine 存储的数据。"],[546,"Curvine Small File Read Performance Test"],[2442,"Curvine supports advanced POSIX features to meet complex business requirements."],[243,"Curvine supports fs-mode. Its core function is to synchronize metadata and file data to the underlying unified file system, UFS, forming a dual guarantee of local storage plus disk fallback. This avoids data loss without affecting system performance:"],[2522,"Curvine supports multiple clients concurrently reading and writing the same file, but it has clear characteristics:"],[1429,"Curvine supports multiple storage backends including OSS, HDFS, S3, MinIO, and more. By default, these are integrated via OpenDAL. Curvine also provides optimized implementations for OSS and HDFS. Select backends with `--ufs` when building:"],[2451,"Curvine supports multiple storage media tiers. With simple configuration, users can specify data storage priority to balance speed and cost."],[82,"Curvine then runs:"],[1850,"Curvine uses a classic Master/Worker architecture. Master nodes manage metadata and cluster coordination, while Worker nodes store and serve data blocks. Metadata consistency and high availability are provided through Raft."],[331,"Curvine uses SPDK as a **remote block device** — the NVMe-oF target can be a physical NVMe drive on the same host, a dedicated SPDK target container, or a remote storage node. The Worker opens `SpdkBdev` handles (analogous to `LocalFile`) and issues read/write I/O through the `BlockIO` trait."],[1736,"Curvine uses TOML-formatted configuration files. An example configuration is located at `conf/curvine-cluster.toml`. The main configuration items include:"],[731,"Curvine version or commit"],[2304,"Curvine volume parameters"],[5812,"Curvine 不遵循 Close-to-Open，而是和本地磁盘文件语义完全一致："],[3288,"Curvine 与 Fluid 集成"],[5155,"Curvine 为高性能、高并发以及海量数据缓存设计，可以在很多场景中使用："],[4038,"Curvine 仓库同时包含 Cargo workspace，以及若干用于打包、部署和测试的顶层目录。"],[5838,"Curvine 优化：会跟踪已打开文件，文件被修改则页缓存自动失效，保证读到最新数据"],[5030,"Curvine 使用 TOML 格式的配置文件。示例配置位于 `conf/curvine-cluster.toml`，主要配置项包括："],[3504,"Curvine 元数据架构的核心设计目标的明确且聚焦，主要围绕四大核心需求展开：一是支持千万至百亿级文件/目录的元数据存储，适配海量小文件、大文件混合的存储场景；二是保障高并发读写场景下的低延迟，应对频繁的文件创建、删除、修改等高频操作；三是实现分布式集群多节点数据一致，避免出现“本地修改后其他节点不可见”的问题；四是兼顾运维便捷性与成本可控，降低部署、监控和故障恢复的复杂度。"],[3535,"Curvine 元数据架构的核心逻辑，可概括为“三层分工、一个权衡、一个兜底”，既保证了速度和海量存储，又兼顾了数据一致性和运维便捷性："],[3495,"Curvine 元数据架构说明"],[5597,"Curvine 卷参数"],[3357,"Curvine 只上报 master 能低成本返回的值：已缓存字节数、缓存容量和文件数。`ufsTotal`、`cachedPercentage`、`cacheHitRatio` 暂时保持为 `0`，直到 Curvine 有权威的 UFS 总量和命中率元数据。这样可以避免把“缓存容量使用率”误写成“Dataset 缓存百分比”。"],[6235,"Curvine 团队评估后，要么将版本加入 `blocked_versions`，要么在本页记录该不兼容。"],[5020,"curvine 在 dockerhub 上提供了 `curvine/curvine-compile` 镜像"],[3558,"Curvine 在核心层面集成了 OpenDAL（Open Data Access Layer，开放数据访问层），为 Curvine 提供强大的存储生态支持。这种集成使得 Curvine 能够与各种存储后端无缝协作，同时保持统一的接口。"],[5731,"Curvine 完全贴合本地磁盘使用习惯。"],[5735,"Curvine 完整支持各类 POSIX 高级特性，满足各类复杂业务需求，具体能力说明如下："],[3618,"Curvine 将 SPDK 作为一种**远程块设备**使用。NVMe-oF target 可以是同一主机上的物理 NVMe 盘、专用的 SPDK target 容器，也可以是远程存储节点。Worker 会打开 `SpdkBdev` 句柄（类似 `LocalFile`），并通过 `BlockIO` trait 发起读写 I/O。"],[5867,"Curvine 将挂载表持久化到元数据中，因此 Curvine 重启时无需重新挂载。但必须遵循一些规则："],[3833,"Curvine 小文件读取性能测试"],[4155,"Curvine 常见的配置输入包括："],[4714,"Curvine 底层存储支持对接 OSS、HDFS、S3、MinIO 等多种后端。默认情况下以 OpenDAL 后端为主；对于 OSS 与 HDFS，也可以构建特定实现。"],[6130,"Curvine 提供 FUSE 文件系统接口。挂载后（例如通过 `bin/curvine-fuse.sh start`），可以在挂载点直接使用标准 Linux 命令："],[5862,"Curvine 提供 UFS（统一文件系统）视图来管理所有支持的分布式存储系统，包括本地文件系统、S3/MinIO、HDFS 等。简单来说，Curvine 的 UFS 挂载，就是做一个“路径映射”，帮你把各种五花八门的外部存储，统一整合到 Curvine 自己的文件系统里，不用再分别记不同存储的访问方式，实现一套接口访问所有存储。"],[6315,"Curvine 提供了直观易用的Web管理界面，用户可以通过浏览器实时监控集群状态、管理文件系统、查看工作节点信息以及配置系统参数。Web界面为集群运维和日常管理提供了可视化的操作平台，无需复杂的命令行操作即可完成大部分管理任务。"],[5421,"Curvine 提供多语言 SDK，使应用可通过 RPC 访问 Curvine 文件系统（元数据访问 Master，块数据访问 Worker），而无需使用 FUSE。"],[3530,"Curvine 支持 fs-mode 模式，核心作用是将元数据和文件数据同步到底层统一文件系统（UFS），形成“本地存储+磁盘兜底”的双重保障，避免数据丢失，同时不影响系统性能："],[5815,"Curvine 支持多客户端并发读写同一个文件，但有明确特性："],[5744,"Curvine 支持多层级存储介质，通过简单配置即可指定数据存储优先级，兼顾速度与成本。"],[6577,"Curvine 文档"],[5143,"Curvine 是一个使用 Rust 编写的高性能分布式缓存系统，采用 Apache 2.0 开源协议发布。它在外部存储系统之上提供统一的缓存文件系统视图，兼顾低延迟元数据访问、高吞吐数据访问以及 POSIX 兼容的 FUSE 集成。"],[5724,"Curvine 是一款分布式文件缓存系统，它能够把集群内的各类存储介质、远端存储资源整合在一起，构建出一个统一的文件目录空间，并且对外提供可直接挂载的文件系统。"],[3458,"Curvine 是分布式文件缓存层。**Master** 负责元数据与块调度；**Worker** 存储块数据并响应读写；**Client**（FUSE、SDK、CLI）向 Master 请求元数据、向 Worker 请求数据。元数据通过 **Raft** 复制以实现高可用。"],[4017,"Curvine 版本或 commit"],[5082,"Curvine 由三个主要服务器端角色加上客户端和 UFS 组成："],[3389,"Curvine 的 CacheRuntimeClass 示例会在 `dataOperationSpecs` 里内联 DataLoad 脚本，因为 Fluid 会把数据操作作为短生命周期 Job 执行。脚本会先从 Fluid runtime JSON 生成 Curvine 配置；如果这个文件没有挂载，再依次回退到 Dataset 元数据、Pod label，以及 `<dataset>-load` 这类 DataLoad 名称规则。"],[3319,"Curvine 的 Fluid 物料在 Curvine 源码中："],[5820,"Curvine 的 FUSE 客户端，可通过配置控制内核层面的元数据缓存，默认缓存 1 秒，显著提升查询效率。"],[5830,"Curvine 自身开发的客户端级缓存，缓存内容比内核缓存更全面："],[5865,"Curvine 路径（CV 路径）：集群内部统一的逻辑路径，固定以 `/` 开头，属于 Curvine 专属的 `cv://` 命名空间，在客户端里就是你能直接访问的挂载点目录，相当于给外部存储起了一个“集群内部通用小名”。"],[4098,"Curvine 路线图"],[3632,"Curvine 通过一层很薄的 FFI 与 SPDK C 库交互，从而将 Rust 代码与 SPDK 的 C ABI 隔离开。这里主要使用三种技术："],[4531,"Curvine 配置（`config.*`）"],[5081,"Curvine 采用分层设计的分布式架构，各组件职责明确，具备良好的可扩展性和高可用性。整个架构主要分为三层：**控制层**（Master）、**存储层**（Worker）、**接入层**（客户端：FUSE、SDK、CLI），共同完成数据的存储、处理和管理。"],[5132,"Curvine 采用分布式架构设计，通过多副本机制和故障转移机制保证系统的高可用性。"],[5247,"Curvine 采用模块化代码组织。当前 `main` 分支的主要组件包括："],[5144,"Curvine 采用经典的 Master / Worker 架构。Master 负责元数据与集群协调，Worker 负责数据块存储与读写服务；元数据一致性与高可用通过 Raft 保证。"],[3369,"Curvine 随后运行："],[5145,"Curvine 面向 AI、分析型计算和数据基础设施场景，当前 `main` 分支提供的主要接入方式包括 Rust CLI、FUSE 和 Java / Python SDK 绑定。"],[5126,"Curvine为了实现高性能、高并发、低资源消耗的目标，采用了以下技术和设计原则："],[4739,"curvine没有最小资源要求，使用很小的资源就支撑极高的并发和流量。这里提供一个参考值："],[5138,"Curvine简介"],[6549,"curvine配置调整如下示例:"],[2640,"Data expiration rules:"],[564,"Data migration tool: `rclone`, using multi-threaded transfer to ensure migration efficiency and stability."],[568,"Data migration: use `rclone` to copy 70,000 images from the local `/data/img/bdd` directory to the Curvine moun